  "c_title": "{sector, select, 1{Alpha Centauri relay} 5{Sirius under attack} 8{Tau Ceti discrepancy} 12{Hidden channel} 16{Orders recovered} 20{The planted core} 22{The outer-galaxy trace} 25{Manual phase control} 26{Triangulum: M33 X-7} other{Continue the network}}",
  "c_body": "{sector, select, 1{The first extrasolar transmission has reached Haven. Anchors in other star systems can now contribute to Earth’s defense.} 5{The expanded network is strengthening Earth’s defense. Unknown raiders are deliberately targeting its relays.} 8{The energy received by Haven is slightly below Tau Ceti’s output. Keep the protection running while we investigate.} 12{Analysis of accumulated transmission records reveals an undocumented outbound channel in Haven’s core. The Phase Anchors themselves are working correctly.} 16{We intercepted enemy command records during the journey. The raiders are Severance, acting on orders from alien masters.} 20{Kepler-90 records show the same core design in alien archives. The ancient OOPART found on Earth was planted there deliberately.} 22{Comparing the Kepler-90 records with the energy trace reveals a route beyond our galaxy. Aliens sent the antimatter Earth to force us to gather energy; the necessary defense lets the core steal a share.} 25{I have found a way to isolate the alien automatic controller. We will use your ship as Haven’s direct phase control point.} 26{This is the aliens’ region of origin, Triangulum M33 X-7. Complete the local anchor grid, sync your ship at the Haven relay, defeat the core guardian, then return to the relay to reverse the transmission.} other{Establish colonies and keep the Phase Anchors transmitting. Earth still needs their energy.}}",
